{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuhuan-e-d3912ce79bd4bba6bea2","title":"《魏略》述赀虏大人檀柘死","accounts":[{"id":"wuhuan-a-d3912ce79bd4bba6bea2","label":"裴注引《魏略·西戎传》","text":"《魏略》述赀虏大人檀柘死","evidence":["wuhuan-q-648614541f38f2f2dd6c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuhuan-p-0896aa9becbec5","role":"去世者","evidence":["wuhuan-q-648614541f38f2f2dd6c"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wuhuan-q-648614541f38f2f2dd6c"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuhuan-q-648614541f38f2f2dd6c","order":6404}],"persons":[{"id":"wuhuan-p-0896aa9becbec5","name":"檀柘","evidence":["wuhuan-q-648614541f38f2f2dd6c","wuhuan-q-6afaf8d655974bbabd7b"],"facts":[{"id":"wuhuan-f-1656317ca1b2e653ef28","text":"汉魏之际赀虏大人。","evidence":["wuhuan-q-6afaf8d655974bbabd7b"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuhuan-q-648614541f38f2f2dd6c","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-42ed887a85ffa9a13b37","layer":"pei","quote":"当汉、魏之际，其大人有檀柘；死后，","attribution":"裴注引《魏略·西戎传》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":479,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-223c764a1a7d3577c3cb","start":111,"end":128},{"id":"wuhuan-q-6afaf8d655974bbabd7b","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-42ed887a85ffa9a13b37","layer":"pei","quote":"赀虏，本匈奴也。匈奴名奴婢为‘赀’。始建武时，匈奴衰，分去。其奴婢亡匿在金城、武威、酒泉北，黑水、西河东西，畜牧逐水草；抄盗凉州，部落稍多，有数万，不与东部鲜卑同也。其种非一：有大胡，有丁令，或颇有羌杂处，由本亡奴婢故也。当汉、魏之际，其大人有檀柘；死后，其枝大人南近在广魏、令居界，有秃瑰来数反，为凉州所杀。今有劭提，或降来，或遁去，常为西州道路患也。","attribution":"裴注引《魏略·西戎传》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":479,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-223c764a1a7d3577c3cb","start":0,"end":177}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
